    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician,",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A Psalm",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of David.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fool hath said in his heart,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no God. They are corrupt, they have done abominable works,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none that doeth good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "looked down from heaven upon the children of men, to see if there were any that did understand,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "seek God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are all gone aside, they are",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "all",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "together become filthy:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none that doeth good, no, not one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have all the workers of iniquity no knowledge? who eat up my people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they eat bread, and call not upon the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There were they in great fear: for God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the generation of the righteous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye have shamed the counsel of the poor, because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his refuge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh that the salvation of Israel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were come",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "out of Zion! when the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bringeth back the captivity of his people, Jacob shall rejoice,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel shall be glad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
